OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds protest over data centre
OL,4,Aplans
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of people have taken part in a
OL,7,Fprotest against plans to build a new
OL,8,Fdata centre because of concerns about
OL,9,Fits effects on the area.
OL,11,FDevelopers want to construct a complex
OL,12,Fon a 101 acre site between Caernarfon
OL,13,Fand Y Felinheli, in Gwynedd, saying it
OL,14,Fcould create more than 900 jobs during
OL,15,Fconstruction and 200 permanent roles.
OL,17,FAbout 300 gathered for a rally in
OL,18,FCaernarfon to highlight their
OL,19,Fopposition. More than 22,500 have
OL,20,Fsigned a petition opposing the plan.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,437,430,260,140,0,100
