OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds protest over data centre
OL,4,Aplans
OL,5,
OL,6,FCanolfan Ddata Menai has previously
OL,7,Fsaid its proposals would "transform and
OL,8,Frevitalise the long-derelict" site as
OL,9,Fwell as offer significant employment.
